said Google is "spying" on people and has no right to publish information about their property on its Maps and Earth sites. The case stems from images taken from the air.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>North Korean workers treated as 'slaves' at Russian drone factory, says new report</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:ef9309c97e160d17723f00857b017349de5a4338f2ec639e7eecd624be419794</id><updated>2026-10-20T13:41:41Z</updated><published>2026-10-20T11:30:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/north-korean-workers-treated-as-slaves-at-russian-drone-factory-says-new-report/a-79710877--a509ee21abbc.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/north-korean-workers-treated-as-slaves-at-russian-drone-factory-says-new-report/a-79710877?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A new report reveals the plight of North Korean workers at a drone factory in Russia. It also raised concerns that Pyongyang could gain hands-on knowledge of advanced weapons systems through the workers it sends there.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Why US investors are snapping up Germany's famed Mittelstand</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:763fc001284c2a46fb2632a50bdfef322e09ea2c38ca834136e00ad70263be68</id><updated>2026-10-20T13:41:45Z</updated><published>2026-10-20T09:06:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/why-us-investors-are-snapping-up-germany-s-famed-mittelstand/a-79705421--453454d6f76c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/why-us-investors-are-snapping-up-germany-s-famed-mittelstand/a-79705421?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Increasing amounts of US capital are flowing into Germany's traditional industrial firms and family-owned businesses. As many business owners struggle to find successors, more companies are becoming acquisition targets.</summary><category term="Business" /></entry><entry><titl