r regional war.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Houthi strike on Yemen government military camp kills at least 50</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:b09c0507b00e48bfc706e5a57137b12c328851eff25cac21552dae66d46cdc9e</id><updated>2026-10-20T13:40:38Z</updated><published>2026-10-19T14:39:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/houthi-strike-on-yemen-government-military-camp-kills-at-least-50/a-79702163--d01e5a08fc37.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/houthi-strike-on-yemen-government-military-camp-kills-at-least-50/a-79702163?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The Iran-backed group has claimed responsibility for the attack which killed new recruits at a military camp. The strikes follow deadly attacks over the weekend blamed on Saudi-led forces.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Rubio visits India with a trip to the world's largest oil refinery topping the agenda</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:da9ef21fc86066b0845a443b7f7573740d47ccee55d993371749e914ee8e8d0e</id><updated>2026-10-20T13:40:38Z</updated><published>2026-10-19T12:31:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/rubio-visits-india-with-a-trip-to-the-world-s-largest-oil-refinery-topping-the-agenda/a-79699826--dd280f73407c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/rubio-visits-india-with-a-trip-to-the-world-s-largest-oil-refinery-topping-the-agenda/a-79699826?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A visit to India this week by Washington's top diplomat will skip New Delhi and instead include the world's largest oil refinery, which processes massive amounts of Russian crude. Is Trump looking for a new deal?</summary><category term="World" /></entry></feed>
